{
  "_about": "Everything done on the farm is one event, Game.record(verb, subject, n) (docs/PLAYER_EXPERIENCE.md Part 1, 'One event stream'). Each verb lists the ribbon counters it adds to: the first rule whose 'kind' matches the subject's catalog kind (or that has no 'kind') counts; a verb with no rules is told (Game.did) but counts for no ribbon. Goals listen to Game.did.",
